 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>From Dawn’s recipe on <a href=\"https://prdp.net/recipe-folder/baka-with-eggs\">prdp.net</a>, rewritten here.</li><li>A Filipino breakfast stew that freezes well.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Credit"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>The browned crust that sticks to the pot when meat sears hard.</li><li>Something wet — here the tomatoes — loosens it so it melts into the sauce.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Fond"
  }
