     "amount_html": "2 lb (~900 g)",
     "name_html": "Stewing beef"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "to taste",
     "name_html": "Salt & pepper"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lift the beef out and pour off part of the fat.</li><li>Tip into the hot pot to deglaze it:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>roma tomatoes <span class=\"amt\">4</span></li><li>yellow onion <span class=\"amt\">1 medium</span></li><li>garlic <span class=\"amt\">1 head</span></li></ul></li><li>When the vegetables have given up their juices, return the beef and stir it through for about a minute.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Deglaze with the vegetables",
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Beef out, drain off some of the fat.",
      "src": "illustrations/baka-with-eggs/2-how1.webp"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Tomatoes, onion and garlic in — scrape up the fond as they release their juice.",
      "src": "illustrations/baka-with-eggs/2-how2.webp"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/baka-with-eggs/2.webp",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~8 min",
   "title": "Deglaze with the vegetables",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lid on, heat <b>low</b>, for <b>2–3 hours</b>.</li><li>Look in and stir every 15–30 minutes — more often if stews are new to you — making sure there’s still liquid and nothing is catching on the bottom.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Stew low, covered",
    "how": [
